 q←id Price body;lines
⍝ A Quote with this id, priced from the catalogue. body has passed VALIDATE.Request.
 lines←{
     p←(##.PRODUCTS.Catalogue.id⍳⊂⍵.productId)⊃##.PRODUCTS.Catalogue
     n←⌊⍵.quantity
     (productId:p.id ⋄ name:p.name ⋄ unitPricePence:p.unitPricePence ⋄ quantity:n ⋄ linePence:n×p.unitPricePence)
 }¨body.items
 q←(id:id ⋄ reference:body.reference ⋄ items:,lines ⋄ totalPence:+/lines.linePence)
